  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組需要 RFTools。它新增了使用 RF 能源來創建維度的機器與工具。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14pt\"><strong>注意</strong>！已停用留言功能，因為我無法在多個平台同時監控。若您想回報錯誤，請前往「Issues」分頁或此處：<a href=\"https://github.com/McJty/RFToolsDimensions/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">RFTools Dimensions 問題追蹤器</a>。若您想一般性討論 RFTools，可至：<a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2229562-rftools-dimension-builder-teleportation-crafter\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC Forums 上的 RFTools</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以透過贊助支持我：<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/McJty\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/McJty</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>介紹影片：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qruPB0cOatQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>截圖：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eYsfMzO.png\" alt=\"峽谷維度\" width=\"1905\" height=\"1041\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/45YJTxW.png\" alt=\"熔岩與礦石球體\" width=\"1905\" height=\"1041\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Dmh5UpW.png\" alt=\"浮空島嶼\" width=\"1905\" height=\"997\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ulDP7HG.png\" alt=\"巨大洞穴\" width=\"1905\" height=\"997\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>感謝！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
